          source="https://codepen.io/ssbit01/pen/RwVOaKw"
          website="https://codepen.io/ssbit01/full/RwVOaKw"
        />
      </li>
      <li>
        <Project
          name="Intro to Python"
          tags={["HTML", "CSS"]}
          source="https://codepen.io/ssbit01/pen/RwNzXrB"
          website="https://codepen.io/ssbit01/full/RwNzXrB"
        >
          <p>My own basic <strong>Python</strong> documentation.</p>
          <p>
            <strong>Python</strong> is a general-purpose, high-level programming language that is known for its simple syntax and powerful libraries.
            It is a popular language for a wide variety of tasks, including <strong>web development</strong>, <strong>data science</strong>,
            and <strong>machine learning</strong>.
          </p>
